ZTEXT00100002a3639bd810d0000000
Documentation and fixture format migration

149 additional authored documents, plain text fixtures, checksum records and
TSV records were encoded through original zero-text make and compared against
the intended payload bytes. Every encoding succeeded. Each output has a real
ZTEXT001 header, exact length and checksum; files were not merely renamed.
The earlier checker/text migration encoded161 containers. The separate Ezero
owner migrated14 files. Current verification reports may add further containers.

Active workflow documents were rewritten around zero-integrate, zero-build,
zero-check and zero-text. Historical notes identify removed runners and past
results as history, not current runnable instructions or current certification.
Top-level README/WORKSTATE/verification/SHA256 and generated artifact removal
were owned by the main integration task; Ezero docs by the Ezero owner.

